    "lean_base_sources": "All 41 'source' files listed below (formalize_11_12/lean-base/OAI/...) are byte-identical to openai/math commit fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb at lean/OAI/... (checked with git show against the local checkout formalize_11_12/math; the recorded source_sha256 values still match). The ports were therefore adapted from openai/math fd4aeeb2e. The Lean development they are compiled against is the pruned fork akashlevy/math@c388e88e6519d139ad2ca5571ef0c7fbf0e245b5 (branch qrh-23-24-pruned), where 40 of these 41 originals are present in their pruned form (their bytes differ from fd4aeeb2e) and one (Detector/LowOriginalPools) was deleted by prune commit 817ddb5e6. formalize_11_12/lean-base is not on the LEAN_PATH of build.py, verify.py, verify_parallel.py, run_comparator.sh or the final rebuild report.",
